{"title":"Standard Of Reincarnation","synopsis":"Keluarga bela diri terbesar Samion\nDaven anggota keluarga Samion adalah seorang Ahli Bela diri berlengan satu\nTerlepas dari ejekan dan penghinaan yang dia dapatkan karena hanya memiliki lengan kiri dia melampaui garis keturunan langsung keluarga Samion seperti seorang jenius\nNamun Pada Akhirnya dia dikhianati oleh keluarga dan orang tuanya Dan mati dalam keadaan mengenaskan\nNamun dia bereinkarnasi\nAku punya Tangan kanan Dia memiliki keluarga baru Tubuh yang berbakat secara alami Pengalaman dari kehidupan masa lalunya Semuanya berubah setelah reinkarnasinya\npetualangan baru ditubuhnya yang baru Serta Balas Dendamnya dimulai","alternative_title":"환생의 정석","author":"Blue Jaeng-i (블루쟁이), Kim Pyung-beom (김평범)","artist":"Lee Sang-kyung (이상경)","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"chapters":[{"id":"c2fb0405-a506-4aae-92e4-bff3ca8c9d6f","number":"182","title":"Chapter 182","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"id":"06e6f674-b376-4aff-957c-44b50a3f1cca","number":"181","title":"Chapter 181","date":"2026-05-17","images":[]},{"id":"97de03ca-271c-4d66-ab5a-37a15e17b087","number":"180","title":"Chapter 180","date":"2026-05-12","images":[]},{"id":"e93a7a93-9c5f-4894-b780-3728641de784","number":"179","title":"Chapter 179","date":"2026-05-03","images":[]},{"id":"19aadf93-2625-4d8d-ad8d-727c65edda68","number":"178","title":"Chapter 178","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id":"7e1ece1b-8755-44b5-aafa-4d6d9e7b5ed7","number":"177","title":"Chapter 177","date":"2026-04-19","images":[]},{"id":"6dc4c604-c7c1-47f2-8c93-9c9c92a5b6e9","number":"176","title":"Chapter 176","date":"2026-04-12","images":[]},{"id":"41140ced-1e7a-4913-acbd-8748f749f058","number":"175","title":"Chapter 175","date":"2026-04-05","images":[]},{"id":"f662da25-e3f7-4112-8d7d-334d2adaefec","number":"174","title":"Chapter 174","date":"2026-03-28","images":[]},{"id":"2b3c05e1-c768-42d2-8488-03067bd335d3","number":"173","title":"Chapter 173","date":"2026-03-23","images":[]},{"id"